# Line endings for the Claude Code Game Studios framework files. Scoped to the
# framework's own folders so nothing under deep/ changes; the Godot project
# keeps its own rules in deep/.gitattributes.

# Shell hooks and scripts must be LF: a CRLF checkout breaks bash on Windows
# Git Bash (stray \r corrupts commands and string comparisons).
.claude/**/*.sh text eol=lf

# awk programs read with `awk -f`; mawk and BWK awk may not tolerate CRLF.
.claude/**/*.awk text eol=lf

# Pattern list Claude Code reads when it creates a worktree; a trailing \r
# would stop every pattern matching.
.worktreeinclude text eol=lf

# Tabular data compared byte-for-byte against freshly generated LF output.
.claude/**/*.tsv text eol=lf

# Markdown under .claude/ is authored LF (tooling substring-matches sentences).
.claude/**/*.md text eol=lf
